: 206.0723876953125, "height": 10.868011474609375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "playing game, great care was taken to remain faithful to ", "x": 325.0, "y": 490.8970031738281, "width": 211.574462890625, "height": 10.868011474609375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "Roshar and the cosmere. New lore and powers described ", "x": 325.0, "y": 503.89697265625, "width": 217.05609130859375, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "in this book are canonical, developed in close partnership ", "x": 325.0, "y": 516.89697265625, "width": 218.14862060546875, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "with Brandon Sanderson. However, a few adjustments ", "x": 325.0, "y": 529.89697265625, "width": 206.91009521484375, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "were made to fit the medium of this collaborative game. ", "x": 325.0, "y": 542.89697265625, "width": 213.37957763671875, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "For example, some flexible Radiant powers have been ", "x": 325.0, "y": 555.89697265625, "width": 205.19061279296875, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "codified into specific mechanical effects; some words ", "x": 325.0, "y": 568.89697265625, "width": 203.41497802734375, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "are capitalized differently for clarity; and some lore is ", "x": 325.0, "y": 581.89697265625, "width": 201.5511474609375, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}, {"text": "merely hinted at, preserving surprises for new readers ", "x": 325.0, "y": 594.89697265625, "width": 205.6190185546875, "height": 10.86798095703125, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "